OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm fined #8m for
OL,4,A'horrendous' sewage spills
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has been fined almost
OL,7,F#8m for a series of pollution-related
OL,8,Foffences over six years.
OL,10,FSouth West Water pleaded guilty at
OL,11,FPlymouth Magistrates' Court after an
OL,12,Finvestigation by the Environment Agency
OL,13,Finto incidents between 2015 and 2021 in
OL,14,FBodmin, Harlyn, Playing Place, and
OL,15,FPolperro in Cornwall, and Plymouth in
OL,16,FDevon.
OL,18,FSentencing, Judge Jo Matson described
OL,19,Fthe pollution as "horrendous" and "very
OL,20,Fsignificant".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
